You might want to have a look at the Text Encoding Initiative Guidlines
which have defined SGML tag sets for many kinds of text: prose, verse,
drama, spoken texts, letters and memoranda, dictionaries, lecical data,
terminological data, language corpora & collections, etc., etc.

